CATEGORIES:Podcast - TWiV
DESCRIPTION:[Podcast: This Week in Virology]\n\nTWiV explains research sho
 wing that Long COVID is associated with reactivation of numerous chronic v
 iruses\, including herpesviruses and anelloviruses\, and with the producti
 on of autoantibodies that target neurological tissues. Hosts:&nbsp\; Vince
 nt Racaniello \, Alan Dove \, and Brianne Barker Click arrow to play Downl
 oad TWiV 1347 (65 MB .mp3\, 107 min) Subscribe (free):&nbsp\; Apple Podcas
 ts \,&nbsp\; RSS \,&nbsp\; email Become a&nbsp\; patron &nbsp\;of&nbsp\;TW
 iV! Links for this episode Support science education at MicrobeTV 3:08 Pos
 itions in Rosenfeld Lab (email) 3:17 Virus reactivation in acute and long 
 COVID-19 (Nature) 4:36 Association between autoantibodies and neurological
  symptoms in long COVID (Cell) 34:39 Letters read on TWiV 1347 1:05:46 Tim
 estamps by&nbsp\; Jolene Ramsey. Thanks! Picks of the Week 1:34:13 Brianne
  &#8211\; Merriam-Webster Time Traveler Feature Alan &#8211\; The Incandes
 cent \, by Emily Tesh Vincent &#8211\; How mosquitoes are conquering the w
 orld — in four charts Listener Picks Vici &#8211\; PBS Eons Charles &#82
 11\; Entomologist Stephen Dobson on releasing modified mosquitoes to fight
  disease Intro music is by&nbsp\; Ronald Jenkees Send your virology questi
 ons and comments to twiv@microbe.tv Content in this podcast should not be 
 construed as medical advice. The post TWiV 1347: No Short Answers for Long
  COVID first appeared on This Week in Virology .\n\nEvent URL: https://www
 .microbe.tv/twiv/twiv-1347/\n\nSource: twiv_podcast
