 rphan enzyme from the cow rumen microbiome that rapidly disperses mature b
 iofilms formed by clinical isolates of Klebsiella pneumoniae at low microm
 olar concentrations\, thereby enhancing antibiotic susceptibility and prom
 oting immune-mediated clearance in a murine wound infection model. We furt
 her discovered CRhAB\, a biofilm-\n\nEvent URL: https://events.broadinstit
 ute.org/event/chemical-biology-supergroup-debasis-das\n\nSource: broad_ins
 titute
